  "main_menu": "🌿 **{bot_name}**\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 **ID:** `{user_id}`\n👥 **Groups:** {groups}\n📡 **Channel:** {channel}\n⏳ **Pending:** {pending}\n\n💎 **Subscription:** {sub}\n⚙️ **Auto Publish:** {auto}\n♻️ **Auto Recycle:** {recycle}\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━",
  "help_text": "📚 **Commands & Help**\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🤖 **Basic Commands:**\n• /start - Main menu\n• /help - Show this help\n• /trial - Activate trial\n• /subscribe - View plans\n• /support - Contact support\n• /developer - Bot info\n• /language - Change language\n• /contests - View active contests\n• /replies - Auto-reply info\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👥 **Group Commands (Admins only):**\n• /syncgroup - Activate bot in group\n• /security - Security settings\n• /panel - Control panel\n• /lock - Lock group\n• /unlock - Unlock group\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🛡️ **Moderation Commands:**\n• /ban @user - Ban member\n• /mute @user - Mute member\n• /warn @user - Warn member\n• /kick @user - Kick member\n• /restrict @user - Restrict member\n• /unban @user - Unban member\n• /pin - Pin a message (reply to it)\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🔐 **Owner & Hidden Admin Commands:**\n• /register_hidden_owner <id> - Register hidden owner\n• /remove_hidden_owner <id> - Remove hidden owner\n• /add_hidden_admin <id> - Add hidden admin\n• /remove_hidden_admin <id> - Remove hidden admin\n• /list_hidden_admins - List hidden admins\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n💡 **Tips:**\n• Use buttons to navigate easily\n• Paid subscription unlocks channel features\n• Bot is completely free for groups\n\n📞 **Support:** @RelaxMgr",
